expected_result: The automatic parent can observe successful publication after realistic preparation and runner queue delays without changing publication admission or daily immutability.
actual_result: "The prior110minute workflow fails the strengthened contract; corrected180minute configuration passes all121 focused tests, linked release tests, TypeScript/build/permissions and full static stages. Release26 passed all nine platform legs and independent npm/Bun/npx/bunx checks; the canceled parent recovered in attempt2 by verifying the existing tag without another publication."
